    ["威廉·黑伍德，这场舞会的主人，却不像一个\n真正的主人。三十出头的面容本该英气逼人，\n眉宇间却笼着一层淡淡的疲惫。 \n他的眼神偶尔扫向某个方向——不是看人，像\n在确认什么。"] = "William Haywood, the host of this ball, does not seem like a \n true host. His face, in his early thirties, should have been imposing, \n but there is a faint layer of exhaustion lingering between his brows. \n His eyes occasionally scan a certain direction—not looking at people, but as if \n confirming something.",
