    ["我们两个多么幸运，能看到如今的金秋湖——哪怕是以灵体的方式。噢，这得感谢格温尼女士。"] = "How lucky we are to see Golden Autumn Lake as it is today—even if it is in the form of spirit bodies. Oh, we must thank Ms. Gwenny for this.",
    ["我们必须协助他，这是“教授”的命令。"] = "We must assist him; this is the 'Professor's' order.",
    ["我可不真偷东西，\r\n玩两天都送回去……"] = "I don't actually steal things,\nI return them after playing with them for two days...",
    ["我宣布——将黑伍德庄园东侧土地，无偿赠予我的管家阿尔伯特先生。"] = "I hereby announce—the land on the east side of Heywood Manor is to be gifted unconditionally to my butler, Mr. Albert.",
