    ["提高攻击600、特殊攻击200，造成伤害时，攻击和特殊攻击额外提高240，持续10秒，还会对目标附加一层挑衅状态，每15秒最多触发1次。\n挑衅：受到伤害增加2.2%，持续10秒。"] = "Increases Attack by 600 and Special Attack by 200. When dealing damage, Attack and Special Attack are additionally increased by 240 for 10 seconds, and a layer of Provocation status is applied to the target. Can be triggered at most once every 15 seconds. \n Provocation: Damage received increased by 2.2%, lasts 10 seconds.",
    ["提高攻击600，普攻命中敌人时，攻击额外提高4.5%，持续8秒，普攻还会为目标附加一层铁火状态。\n铁火：每秒受到伤害，持续4秒，最多叠加3层。"] = "Increases Attack by 600. When basic attacks hit an enemy, Attack is additionally increased by 4.5% for 8 seconds. Basic attacks also apply one stack of Iron Fire status to the target. \n Iron Fire: Takes damage every second for 4 seconds, stacks up to 3 times.",
